Valle, D.; Mintz, J.; Brack, I. V. 2024. Estimation and interpretation problems and solutions when using proportion covariates in linear regression models <https://esajournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/ecy.4256>. Ecology e4256.

